1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,920
PUMP!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,145
Welcome to Five-Second Camp!

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,387
DON'T SNEEZE!

4
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,970
Bless you. Next!

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,319
STRAP IN!

6
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:20,920
CATCH!

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Too easy?

8
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:27,731
SPEED UP!

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,077
DODGE!

10
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,200
ZIP!

11
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:35,863
SALUTE!

12
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,365
One life left, cadet.

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,420
BOSS STAGE!

14
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,661
LAND IT!

15
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:45,370
PULL!

16
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,420
Oh no.

17
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,831
You made it, cadet. Salute!
